Happy Monday!!

March! Here's the rundown for the week. Nothing in here needs anything from anyone, I just like everyone starting the week on the same page.

NORTHSTAR - Elise is sending the Fresno contact list this morning and Hana will line up the field-mapping workshop with the planners this week. April 1 for the SAP connector is the date on everyone's whiteboard and I have not heard a single wobble from their side. Elise is a joy to work with, honestly. If every procurement lead ran their inbox like her we would all be home by five.

HALBERD - the February usage report went to Greta on Thursday with the line-by-line notes, so Martin has it ahead of their budget meeting on the 5th. Greta also asked for the renewal paperwork for the May 1 anniversary, so I'm putting the proposed terms together with Reno folded in. Line 3 is the one to watch: usage dipped a little while Sanjay's team preps the MES upgrade, which is normal for a prep window and I flagged it in the report before anyone else could.

VERITAS - Anika's spec-reference field went live last week and the AS9100 auditor is apparently a happy person now. Dmitri sent Hana a gif. That is what a healthy account looks like!! Renewal is June, nothing to do until the QBR.

COASTLINE - second corrugator line has been on the platform since mid-February and the exception counts are exactly where we said they'd be. Hana's doing a quarterly check-in with them in a couple of weeks.

PINEWOOD DAIRY COOPERATIVE - NEW!! Inbound from the website Friday night (10:48pm, which tells you something about dairy hours). Lucia Ferraro, VP Operations, four plants across the Central Valley, wants to talk implementation time and references. Leo has a discovery call booked for Thursday and I'll sit in the back and behave.

Numbers: 11 open opportunities, $1.3M weighted (up from $1.1M at the start of Feb), 2 pilots in scoping. If Pinewood turns into a pilot we're at three and I definately think it does.

Also! I'm working up a spring events list (two regional manufacturing shows, a customer roundtable, one podcast that keeps emailing me). More when it's ready.

Have a great week!!

